---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-r from-teal to-navy py-16 text-white sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="portfolio-cta-heading">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="page-hero-glow absolute -right-10 top-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-yellow blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6" data-reveal data-reveal-variant="scale">
    <h2 id="portfolio-cta-heading" class="text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-4xl">
      Ingin Hasil Serupa untuk <span class="highlight-underline">Bisnis Anda</span>?
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-white/85">
      Ceritakan tantangan digital Anda. Tim {site.name} siap merancang solusi custom dengan timeline dan anggaran yang
      transparan.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/#kontak"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-yellow px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-navy transition hover:bg-yellow-bright hover:scale-105"
      >
        Mulai Proyek
      </a>
      <a
        href="/profil"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/30 px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold transition hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        Profil Perusahaan
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
